WEBVTT

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:06.690
That new transfer student...

00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:09.090
I think we'll get along with him.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:10.320
You might be right.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.170
He's a bit strange, though.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:12.990
Look.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.430
Speak of the devil.

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:15.450
Tsukano-kun!

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:21.600
I'm Shibayama, and this is Hosotani-kun.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.400
We're in your class.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.140
How do you like your new school?

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:26.400
I love it!

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.540
Not just the school, 
but the whole town, as well.

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:32.220
I think there might be some
mysterious things to see.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.940
You think so?

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:36.640
I've lived in this town my whole life,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.260
but I've never seen
anything that interesting.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:40.500
Yeah.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.730
It's actually pretty boring to us.

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:48.510
We're making a group for people
interested in seeing mysterious things.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:51.470
We call it the Supernatural Club.

00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:54.190
Would you consider joining?

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:56.180
We won't bore you.

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:57.340
Really?

00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:59.200
I'd love to join!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.000
I love stuff like that.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.150
Okay. Welcome, then.

00:01:02.150 --> 00:01:04.510
Tsukano-kun, try not to be shocked by this,

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:06.260
but this guy has special powers.

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:08.110
He's even going to be on TV.

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:09.060
Really?

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:13.900
Nah, it's not quite the same
as having super powers.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:15.970
Wow, that's amazing!

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:17.500
Show me, please!

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:20.860
Okay, we'll have a welcome
party for you after school.

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:22.440
I'll show you then.

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:26.300
I'm gonna see something amazing 
right after transferring here!

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:28.740
What's up?

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:33.370
Take a look at this weird flower!

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.220
An eyeball!

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:39.520
When did flowers like that start growing here?

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:41.250
Th-They're creepy...

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.270
This town is so great!

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:45.410
This'll be fun!

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:24.930
I'd like to introduce the newest
member of the Supernatural Club.

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:26.430
This is Tsukano-kun.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:27.380
Nice to meet you!

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:28.460
Nice to meet you.

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:30.540
Man, I sure was surprised, though.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:34.620
I tried dissecting one of these
supernatural plants,

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:36.560
and it was exactly like a real eyeball.

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:39.440
What?

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:40.840
Do you see something?

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:41.820
Yeah.

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.350
It's a spirit that can't move on.

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:45.630
The spirit of a warrior.

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:48.020
Spirits bound to the earth
inhabited the plants

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.910
and started a colony out there.

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:53.230
So you can see spirits!

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:54.960
It's not that big a deal.

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:05.460
Bravo!

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:07.690
Wasn't that impressive, Tsukano-kun?

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:09.690
Yeah, it was!

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:12.040
Shibayama-kun, can I have a try?

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.390
Can you do it, too?

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:16.810
I don't know, but it made me want to try.

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:19.090
True.

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:20.990
You won't know unless you try.

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:23.020
Okay, Tsukano-kun,

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:26.400
picture the broken spoon in your mind.

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:29.870
Concentrate on that, and nothing else.

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:34.450
Break... Break...

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:37.780
Tsukano-kun, that was amazing!

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:39.920
You have super powers, too!

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:42.500
No, no, sorry.

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:44.210
That was just a joke.

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:45.480
I'll show you again.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:51.510
I bend the spoon's neck 
until it weakens, like this,

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:53.600
until just when it's about to break...

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:55.330
Then...

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.660
I didn't see you do that.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:02.710
Yeah, you did it just like
Shibayama-kun did.

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:05.440
It's easy if you practice enough.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.910
It's the same thing magicians do.

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:09.570
Just so you know,

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:12.280
I'm using just my mind to do it.

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:13.790
Please don't misunderstand.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:15.650
Yes, of course!

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:20.170
I was cheating because I don't
have powers like you do.

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:22.960
Right, no one's misunderstanding.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.190
Right.

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:28.000
Well, this is rare.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:31.240
I never see you alone.

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:33.010
Oh, Kitagawa-kun.

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:34.810
Where's Shibayama?

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:36.940
He's doing some mental
training in the classroom.

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:38.620
Mental training?

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.020
He seemed like he wanted to be alone.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.500
That sounds like him.

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:46.280
That transfer student really shook him up.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.990
Huh? What do you mean?

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.810
That magic trick from yesterday.

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:53.290
He pulled off the same
thing Shibayama did.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:55.510
But it wasn't the same thing.

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:57.470
Well, let's hope not.

00:05:57.470 --> 00:06:01.440
Kitagawa-kun, you aren't doubting
Shibayama-kun, are you?

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:02.960
No, you've got it all wrong...

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:03.710
Yo!

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:07.180
Hosotani-kun and Kitagawa-kun, 
so this is where you were.

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:09.190
I wanted to talk to Shibayama-kun,

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:12.690
but he wouldn't answer me,
so I came to look for you.

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:15.400
I found something on a morning walk.

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:17.840
Your town has an awesome waterfall!

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:18.560
Waterfall?

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:19.520
You know,

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:23.560
the waterfall up the trail
to the north of the school.

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:25.400
Was there a waterfall there?

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:26.450
I dunno.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:28.490
Huh? You didn't know about it?

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:32.910
We'll check it out as a club after school!

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:37.490
Are you sure there's a waterfall?

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:40.420
This path is part of the school's
marathon course,

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.150
but I've never seen a waterfall.

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:43.810
It's awesome!

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:46.010
I can't believe you've never seen it.

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:48.340
There, listen closely.

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:56.100
You're right.

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.300
I hear a waterfall.

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:04.760
I can't believe it.

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:08.590
Why haven't we ever seen 
this waterfall before?

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:09.820
It's supernatural.

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:12.590
It really feels supernatural.

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:15.570
I'm glad you're talking again,
Shibayama-kun.

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:17.300
I thought you'd never speak again.

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:20.090
Shibayama-kun, I was worried, too.

00:07:20.090 --> 00:07:25.220
But I guess you need to prepare
seriously to be on TV.

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:27.700
Well, that wasn't the reason.

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:29.900
The truth is... I'm actually concerned.

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:32.100
Concerned? About what?

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:37.520
Concerned that people won't 
be surprised by a bent spoon.

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:39.920
Everyone's an expert these days.

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:43.390
I need to do something new.

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:47.380
Shibayama-kun, there's something 
mysterious about this waterfall.

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:51.310
I actually stood on those rocks 
under the waterfall this morning.

00:07:51.310 --> 00:07:54.080
Getting there was a little dangerous, though.

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:56.480
What do you think happened?

00:07:56.480 --> 00:07:58.290
What happened?

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:00.010
Watch this!

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:10.650
Tsukano-kun, what was that?

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:13.930
I think it's the force of the waterfall.

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:18.500
Maybe, if you stand under this waterfall,
you obtain a strange power!

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:21.410
Could it be true?

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:25.860
Class,

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:28.740
I have something to ask you.

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:31.250
As some of you probably know,

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:35.200
Shibayama-kun from our class
has been missing for two days.

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:39.070
If anyone knows where he
might be, please speak up.

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:42.670
Where could Shibayama-kun have gone?

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:45.300
So many strange things
have been happening.

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:47.650
The eyeball plants growing,

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:49.560
the waterfall that appeared
out of nowhere...

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:51.880
Now, to top it all off,
Shibayama-kun is missing.

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:53.960
Hey, Kitagawa-kun,

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:57.200
can you use your ability to see
spirits to find Shibayama-kun?

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:01.720
Well... I do sense something unpleasant.

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:04.880
I feel his spirit energy from this direction.

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:05.810
I'm sure of it.

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:08.770
Shibayama is at the
bottom of that waterfall.

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:11.100
The bottom of the waterfall?

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:16.110
Hey, Kitagawa-kun, are you sure?

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.100
If my spirit-sensing ability is correct,

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:20.070
he's down there in the water.

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:22.000
Then we have to help him!

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.920
No, it's too late!

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:27.110
He's a spirit bound to this place now.

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:30.640
It would be impossible to retrieve
his body from the bottom of that pool.

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:33.140
Shibayama-kun...

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:36.430
He was worried about his super powers.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:41.310
Maybe he threw himself in 
to escape the pressure.

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:44.480
I can see his spirit up there!

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:45.600
Kitagawa-kun.

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:47.130
You're wrong.

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:48.130
What?

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:50.080
Shibayama-kun didn't commit suicide.

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:52.360
Then what happened?

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:55.900
Shibayama-kun wanted to 
stand under the waterfall.

00:09:55.900 --> 00:10:00.080
He thought that doing so would
give him a strange power.

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:02.620
But then he fell...

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:05.800
Shibayama-kun...

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:15.510
I feel like more scary things
are going to happen.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:17.510
Hey!

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.220
Guys! You won't believe this!

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:21.550
What's wrong, Tsukano-kun?

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:23.310
You won't believe it!

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:25.770
I was on a walk and saw
something amazing!

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:27.250
Come with me!

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.770
What is it now?

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:31.880
There's a mysterious lake
about a kilometer from here!

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:33.670
I saw something there!

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:34.910
A lake?

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:37.600
See? This is it.

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:39.780
Th-This can't be!

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:42.260
This was a new housing development!

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:43.620
Where are all the houses?

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.120
And the people living in them?

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.720
Where did they go?

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:48.720
I couldn't believe it!

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:52.140
So can you guys guess what I saw?

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:53.600
Tsukano-kun, stop!

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:56.160
Shibayama-kun might be dead,

00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:58.640
under that waterfall you found!

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:02.390
It was you who told him about
going under the waterfall!

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:03.780
Wait a second!

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:07.140
It's almost like you're
saying it's my fault he died.

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:09.540
We don't know that he's dead!

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:14.320
Relax, Hosotani-kun. You're right.

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:17.400
We don't know for sure.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:20.160
Tsukano-kun, what's so funny?

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:25.440
How can you all be losing your nerve?

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:28.630
You're Supernatural Club 
members, aren't you?

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:34.550
Seeing these things happen
should get your hearts racing!

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:38.110
Why aren't you trying
to enjoy them more?

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:41.800
Of course it's dangerous!
Why wouldn't it be?

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:44.180
But if you're afraid of danger,

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:47.220
don't go looking for supernatural phenomena!

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:54.320
There, look!

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:56.290
That's the thing I saw!

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:58.870
A giant creature, 
alive since prehistoric times!

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:04.490
Dinosaurs are still alive!

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:13.000
Things started to change in this 
town after he transferred here.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:15.400
Yes, Tsukano Ryou...

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:19.010
Strange things started happening
the moment he transferred here.

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:25.110
Everything that's happened
was caused by Tsukano Ryou.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:36.980
Who's knocking this late at night?

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:39.330
Hey, Mai.

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:41.000
Open the door.

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:44.370
It's me, Shibayama.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:45.940
Open the door.

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:47.460
Shibayama-kun?

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:49.560
Shibayama-kun? He's alive!

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:51.680
Hang on, I'll open the door!

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:53.290
Shibayama-kun!

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:04.520
What was that?

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:05.680
I don't know!

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:08.260
Hey, open up.

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:10.310
Mai, it's me.

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.860
It sounds like Shibayama-kun.

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:13.850
Are you saying that's Shibayama-kun?

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:15.580
It looked like...

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.560
...a drowned corpse.

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:20.020
Mai...

00:13:20.930 --> 00:13:22.530
Mai...

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:40.500
Kitagawa-kun...

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:44.000
Hey, guys.

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:49.370
I got back from cram school to find my 
house gone and these things in its place.

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:50.600
It's crazy.

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:54.080
Oh, you guys are here, too!

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:57.330
You really are the Supernatural Club!

00:13:57.330 --> 00:14:00.260
Look at these humongous monuments!

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:01.950
Kitagawa-kun, listen!

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:04.150
It's him! He's causing all of this!

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:08.110
Tsukano-kun is remaking
our town into Bizarro World!

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:11.400
I'm making this town into Bizarro World?

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.430
Don't make such strange accusations.

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:16.880
I'm just taking walks in search
of mysterious things.

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:20.300
How would I make
these things, anyway?

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:28.470
Shibayama-kun sure got bloated 
before coming back to life!

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.420
Wh-What?

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:32.200
Shibayama?

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:34.320
Are you Shibayama?

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:43.310
Incredible!

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:47.800
You spent so long in that pool
that you received a great power,

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:50.240
even though you're a corpse!

00:14:57.470 --> 00:14:59.520
I'm not gonna let you beat me!

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:02.260
I'll kill you for sure this time, Shibayama!

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:08.970
Kitagawa-kun, that was impressive!

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:12.640
I know. You went under the waterfall.

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:16.470
I was watching the entire thing.

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:20.950
Shibayama-kun meant to go under the waterfall
late at night, but you pushed him from behind

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:24.150
and then went under
the waterfall yourself.

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:27.360
Oh, you knew?

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:31.610
My spirit sense was a sham, 
but this is real!

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:36.730
Tsukano-kun, I like your Bizarro World!

00:15:36.730 --> 00:15:41.050
Let's make this town a lot more fun!

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:44.940
Sorry, Kitagawa-kun.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:47.080
I can't accept.

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:48.700
Such a shame.

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:51.930
<i>The next day,</i>

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:55.510
<i>the transfer student transferred again,</i>

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:58.000
<i>and the town returned to normal.</i>

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:02.060
<i>But Shibayama-kun never returned,</i>

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:06.000
<i>and Kitagawa-kun later vanished, as well.</i>

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:12.000
<i>Rumor has it he went
looking for Tsukano Ryou.</i>

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:16.200
<i>Still, I wonder if that transfer student</i>

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:22.480
<i>is discovering mysterious
things at his new school, too.</i>

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:27.920
Collection No. 055

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:27.920
<b>Supernatural 
Transfer Student</b>

00:16:43.760 --> 00:16:46.890
Brother, if you don't inter her,

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:49.010
Yuki-chan won't be able to go to heaven.

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:53.220
Yuki!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:55.700
<b>Scarecrow</b>

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:55.700
Collection No. 035

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:01.200
What are you doing here?!

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:05.040
I brought flowers for Yuki-san...

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.260
How dare you?!

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:11.010
Yuki wouldn't have died if 
you hadn't come into her life!

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:14.610
If only you hadn't opposed 
our marriage, Father...

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:16.190
Don't you call me "Father"!

00:17:16.190 --> 00:17:16.960
Leave!

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:18.930
I loved Yuki-san!

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:22.000
You damned weasel! Just you wait!

00:17:24.320 --> 00:17:26.960
Yuki, it's me.

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:29.530
There was no need for you to die.

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:32.850
Don't you see this scarecrow?

00:17:32.850 --> 00:17:35.120
It's to keep weasels like you away!

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.620
Excuse me.

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:50.500
Yuki...

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:52.360
This is Yuki.

00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:55.210
Yuki, do you recognize your father?

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:57.720
Answer me, please!

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:10.640
It does look just like Numata-san's 
daughter. What skillful work.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.150
Everyone,

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:16.530
my daughter's soul has 
inhabited the scarecrow.

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:17.570
See?

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:20.000
It's like she's alive again.

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:23.600
But she doesn't answer,
no matter what you say.

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:26.870
Earlier, I tried taking her home,

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:30.140
but she quickly turned back 
into a regular scarecrow.

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:34.840
That's why I dressed her in clothes
she liked in life and put her here.

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:37.500
They look good on her.

00:18:57.670 --> 00:18:59.580
I'm telling you to stop this!

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:03.210
Don't you think it's madness
to put a scarecrow on a grave?

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:05.870
I'm not putting the scarecrow
here so it'll become Shigeru.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.440
I just want to see him, 
even if it's just a scarecrow!

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:10.710
Don't you think it's creepy?

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:13.530
How can scarecrows look
like people who have died?!

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:16.920
Aren't you sad that Shigeru died?

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:19.000
Calling it creepy...

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:20.950
Why are you so against it?!

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:24.050
Is there some reason you don't
want me to stand it up?

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:26.570
Okay.

00:19:26.570 --> 00:19:28.600
If it means that much
to you, we'll stand it up.

00:19:40.590 --> 00:19:41.530
Yuki...

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:56.000
Toshio-san.

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:01.260
Yuki, you're alive?

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:03.380
Marry me.

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:05.730
I don't care what your father says.

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:06.680
Really?

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:09.720
Yes. I'll never let you go.

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:12.980
Even if I'm... that?

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:19.860
<i>It was a dream.</i>

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:24.380
<i>Why was I sleeping here?</i>

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:26.370
<i>I remember coming here during the day,</i>

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:28.740
<i>but I'm sure I went home.</i>

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:05.280
Why...

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:09.200
Why is Shigeru making this face?

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:11.910
D-Don't ask me.

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:14.560
I told you not to!

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:16.370
He's looking at you.

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:17.680
It's your eyes playing tricks.

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:20.430
I'll rip out this creepy scarecrow!

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:22.130
Dear, no!

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.630
Move!

00:21:28.340 --> 00:21:31.970
You killed Shigeru.

00:21:50.300 --> 00:21:52.010
He's dead.

00:23:34.950 --> 00:23:39.930
Collection
